          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/subprocess-command-injection-executable-path-validation",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Subprocess Command Injection & Executable Path Validation — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxCore/Session/ClaudeCLISession.swift\n\nClaudeCLISession launches the claude CLI using Foundation Process with explicit URL, argument array ([String]), and environment dictionary. No shell command string interpolation is used. ClaudeLocator enforces file ownership and POSIX permission checks (mode 0o755/0o700, parent folder non-world-writable) on custom executable overrides."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Sources/PairVoxCore/Session/ClaudeCLISession.swift"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "strix": {
              "coverage_outcome": "no_issue_found",
              "risk_area": "Subprocess Command Injection & Executable Path Validation",
              "surface": "Sources/PairVoxCore/Session/ClaudeCLISession.swift",
              "recorded_by": "SAST Triage Agent",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/remote-pairing-cryptographic-transport-security",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Remote Pairing & Cryptographic Transport Security — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxLink/LinkHost.swift\n\nReviewed LinkHost.swift in detail. Enforces mutual HMAC-SHA256 handshake and ChaCha20Poly1305 frame AEAD encryption with 64-bit sequence counters. Pre-auth limits cap global pre-auth at 8 and per-peer at 3 with 10s timeouts. Max 3 connections per device. Approval authorization rules enforce presentation checks, truncation limits, device biometrics for high-risk requests, and stale request expiration (300s)."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Sources/PairVoxLink/LinkHost.swift"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "strix": {
              "coverage_outcome": "no_issue_found",
              "risk_area": "Remote Pairing & Cryptographic Transport Security",
              "surface": "Sources/PairVoxLink/LinkHost.swift",
              "recorded_by": "PairVoxLink Test Runner",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/permission-policy-folder-scope-enforcement",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Permission Policy & Folder Scope Enforcement — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxCore/Policy/PermissionPolicy.swift\n\nPermissionPolicy and FolderGrants use symlink-resolved path canonicalization (resolvingSymlinksInPath) to prevent traversal. Folder grants for shell commands strictly disqualify commands containing variables, command substitution ($ or backticks), inline code interpreters (python -c, node -e), or redirection operators."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Sources/PairVoxCore/Policy/PermissionPolicy.swift"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "strix": {
              "coverage_outcome": "no_issue_found",
              "risk_area": "Permission Policy & Folder Scope Enforcement",
              "surface": "Sources/PairVoxCore/Policy/PermissionPolicy.swift",
              "recorded_by": "SAST Triage Agent",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/credential-storage-diagnostic-exposure",
          "ruleIndex": 4,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Credential Storage & Diagnostic Exposure — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxApp/Support/KeychainStore.swift\n\nKeychainStore saves Anthropic API keys in the macOS Keychain with kSecAttrAccessibleWhenUnlocked. Device keys are stored in Keychain or 0600 file stores. LogRedactor scrubs API keys, bearer tokens, emails, and usernames before diagnostic export. Gitleaks and Trufflehog confirmed 0 secrets in product code."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Sources/PairVoxApp/Support/KeychainStore.swift"
                }
