            "text": "Permission policy risk classification & voice approval guardrails — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxCore/Policy/PermissionPolicy.swift\n\nReviewed PermissionPolicy.swift. Risk classification correctly categorizes tools, file writes, and bash commands. Protected folders (PairVox settings & Claude config) are rated high risk. MCP tools force screen confirmation. Risk level low/medium/high and voice approvability logic verified."
