          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Directory access control, symlink traversal, & shell auto-approval scope — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxCore/Policy/FolderGrants.swift\n\nReviewed FolderGrants.swift and FolderScope. FolderScope.resolved() recursively resolves symlinks up to 32 depth (falling back to unresolvable). Shell grants strictly disqualify command variables, backticks, globs, redirects, and cd leaving the folder."
          },
