          "message": {
            "text": "Device Secret Key Storage, Keychain Access, and Distribution Build Isolation — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxLink/DeviceKeyStore.swift\n\nReviewed DeviceKeyStore.swift. KeychainDeviceKeyStore uses kSecAttrAccessibleAfterFirstUnlockThisDeviceOnly without iCloud sync. FileDeviceKeyStore uses 0700 dir, 0600 file permissions, atomic file replacement, and Time Machine exclusion. Distribution builds force Keychain storage. Legacy import marker prevents planted key attacks."
