            "text": "Device Pairing Protocol, HMAC Proof Verification, & Anti-Bruteforce Controls — No issue identified: Sources/PairVoxLink/Pairing.swift\n\nReviewed Pairing.swift. Offers use 128-bit random secrets valid for 120s. Proofs use constant-time HMAC-SHA256 comparison. Device names sanitized against control/newlines/bidi injection. Anti-bruteforce caps wrong attempts at 3 per peer and 12 total. Grants delivered via ChaCha20Poly1305 sealed boxes with Mac user approval gate."
